{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的罪"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华说：",{"text":"“你们在耶路撒冷街头四处看看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在广场找找，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你们能找到一个公正诚实的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就赦免这城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然他们凭永活的耶和华起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却口是心非。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你关注的不是诚实吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你责打他们，他们不感到疼痛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你严惩他们，他们仍不受教。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们拒不悔改，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"脸比石头还硬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我想：“他们贫穷、愚昧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不明白耶和华的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不知道他们上帝的法令。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要找他们的首领说话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这些首领明白耶和华的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道他们上帝的法令。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，他们却一致折断轭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挣开绳索。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，林中的狮子必袭击他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒野的豺狼必残害他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豹子也蹲伏在他们的城外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伺机撕裂出城的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们罪大恶极，屡屡叛道。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“耶路撒冷啊，我怎能赦免你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的儿女背弃我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凭假神起誓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我供应他们的一切需要，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却纵情淫乱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"涌向娼妓的家。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们像吃得肥壮、发情的公马，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"个个垂涎邻居的妻子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能不惩罚他们呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能不亲自报应这样的国民呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要上去毁坏她的葡萄园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但不可彻底毁坏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要砍掉枝子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为那些枝子不属于耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家和犹大家全然背叛我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“他们毁谤耶和华说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘祂不会管的，灾祸不会临到我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们必不会遇见刀剑和饥荒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知不过是一阵风，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的话并非来自上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们预言的灾祸必降临到自己身上。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"因此，万军之上帝耶和华对我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“因为他们说了这话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我的话在你口中成为火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们像柴一样被烧毁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家啊，我要使一个国家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一个历久不衰的古国从远方来攻击你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不明白他们的语言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也听不懂他们说的话。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都是勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的箭袋像敞开的坟墓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必吞噬你们的庄稼和粮食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬你们的儿女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬你们的牛羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬你们的葡萄和无花果，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用刀剑摧毁你们所依靠的坚城。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶和华说：“即使在那时，我也不会彻底毁灭你们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耶利米啊，如果有人问，‘为什么我们的上帝耶和华这样待我们？’你可以对他们说，‘你们怎样背弃耶和华，在自己的土地上供奉外族的神明，也要怎样在异地他乡服侍外族人。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"“要向雅各家宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在犹大传讲，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘听着，你们这群愚昧无知的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们视而不见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听而不闻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你们不该敬畏我吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你们在我面前不该颤抖吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我以沙石为海的界限，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使水永远不能越过它。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"汹涌的波涛不能逾越，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"澎湃的海浪不能漫过。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你们这些人心里顽固，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"悖逆成性。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们离我而去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们心中从不说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们要敬畏我们的上帝耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂按时降下秋雨和春雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让我们按时收割。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的罪过使你们不再风调雨顺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的罪恶使你们失去祝福。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民中有恶人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们像捕鸟人一样埋伏等候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"设下网罗陷害人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的家里充满了诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像笼子装满了鸟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们变得有财有势，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃得肥胖红润，坏事做尽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不秉公审判，不为孤儿申冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不为穷人主持公道。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“我怎能坐视不理呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能不惩罚这样的国家呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这地方发生了一件令人震惊、恐惧的事，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是先知说假预言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司滥用权力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民却以此为乐。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但当最后的结局来临时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们还能做什么呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}